{"asset_key":"ep2/quest_story_12225390","episode":"ep2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"12225390","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:2:1222539001:0":{"text":"おーい、お前さんたち！こっちだ、こっち！","source_cn":"你们几个，过来！过来！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7CD21E44B1A41FFF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1222539002:1":{"text":"よっほっほっほっ！持つべきは友だな！ささ、思いっきりハグさせてくれ！","source_cn":"嚯哈哈哈哈！不愧是我的朋友，让我给你们一个拥抱！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1B00F373C21143CD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1222539003:1":{"text":"ちょちょちょい待てって！急に何なんだ？","source_cn":"慢着慢着，好端端的，怎么回事？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x01238998B4C23975","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1222539004:1":{"text":"ソニアさんから聞いたぞ、ワシの自慢の我が子たちを、カタストロフと戦わせてくれるそうだな！","source_cn":"索尼娅告诉我了，让我带这些精心打造的孩子去和恶魔打一场。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBCCCC97088083A63","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1222539005:0":{"text":"死海の艦隊との戦いが終わってからというもの、活躍する機会がなくて、みんなイライラしてたんだ。","source_cn":"和死潮舰队决战之后，他们闹着要再展示展示身手，可根本没...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC358D24D9E6CF1EC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1222539006:0":{"text":"いや～まさか、カタストロフ相手に試し撃ちできる機会が巡ってくるとは！思いついたやつはまさに天才だな！","source_cn":"谁能想到，用恶魔试炮的机会竟然从天而降！不管是谁提出的...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD1EBEA74C0FFF4C2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:8:1222539006":{"text":"いや～まさか、カタストロフ相手に試し撃ちできる機会が巡ってくるとは！思いついたやつはまさに天才だな！","source_cn":"谁能想到，用恶魔试炮的机会竟然从天而降！不管是谁提出的想法，那个人真是天才！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD1EBEA74C0FFF4C2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1222539009:0":{"text":"準備はどんな感じだ？もう船に積み込み始めてるようだが。","source_cn":"东西准备得怎么样？我看已经在装船了？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6E60CC4547FBFE3D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1222539010:1":{"text":"大砲はもう全部積み終わった。残るは弾薬が数箱ってとこだな。","source_cn":"火炮都就位了，还差几箱弹药。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDBD0F3BEC2B18331","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1222539011:0":{"text":"ブラッディ・マリーのやつらがどんくさくてよお！","source_cn":"这几个血薇帮的小兄弟，手脚不麻利！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE4335CCA6943E736","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1222539012:0":{"text":"えっ、だってあんたが箱を運ぶときは気を付けろって……","source_cn":"呃，之前是你说，装箱搬运时要小心点？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x672975D87042AA15","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1222539013:0":{"text":"気を付けるのは当然だろう！導火線がしっけて使いものにならなくなったり、ぶつかった拍子に爆発でもしたらどうする！","source_cn":"当然要小心！火药引信有可能受潮，你们要是毛手毛脚的磕了...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCE2BF319AFC1F9C8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1222539014:1":{"text":"そうなったら、ワシの大事な子どもたちが、船ごと海に沈んじまうんだぞ！","source_cn":"那这一船的好宝贝就都要葬身水底了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEDA61241B8763FF6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1222539015:1":{"text":"そんなっ……理不尽すぎる！","source_cn":"这……不能既要又要呀！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x999B6C6C1C22264B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1222539016:0":{"text":"ロンロンたちも手伝いましょう！早く終われば、その分早く島に行ってカタストロフと戦えます！","source_cn":"我们也来帮忙吧，赶快收拾妥当，就可以去对付藏梦岛的恶魔了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE89AB20A61EBC7BE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:24:1222539017:1":{"text":"そうね。アルマスさんも危険な状態ですし。あとは私たちに任せてください！","source_cn":"是呀，奥曼斯的状况不能久等，剩下的就交给我们吧！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x01852EF00EB9DD7A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:8:0:1":{"text":"ソニアのアイデアなんだ。","source_cn":"其实是索尼娅的主意","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x2E8F408A4EF2EADB","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_differs","male":"ソニアのアイデアなんだ。","female":"ソニアのアイデアなのよ。","variant_male_record_index":"67216","variant_female_record_index":"67217","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:26:1222539007:0":{"text":"本当か？ならもう少しこの街にとどまって、事務所の送風システムでも改善してやろうかね。","source_cn":"真的？那我就多留一阵，给她改造改造话事处通风系统吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9B52161BAA886322","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:27:1222539008:0":{"text":"だがこれも、お前さんたちがカタストロフの情報を持ってきてくれたおかげだ！","source_cn":"说来说去，也得感谢你们带来了恶魔的消息！嚯哈哈哈！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFDEDBD716AD340D1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:8:1:2":{"text":"そうさ、僕は天才なんだ。","source_cn":"我是天才，没错！","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x59454D3E1A727968","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_differs","male":"そうさ、僕は天才なんだ。","female":"そうよ、私は天才なの。","variant_male_record_index":"67218","variant_female_record_index":"67219","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:呼金":{"text"